WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by HOOKLINE — positioned for vertical safe area.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.011 line:82% align:center
So the question
everyone asks is how we

00:00:03.011 --> 00:00:06.096 line:82% align:center
shipped a product
in eleven weeks with

00:00:06.096 --> 00:00:09.254 line:82% align:center
three engineers, and
the honest answer is

00:00:09.254 --> 00:00:11.600 line:82% align:center
that we did not
ship a product.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.466 line:82% align:center
We shipped one workflow,
extremely well,

00:00:14.466 --> 00:00:17.246 line:82% align:center
and then we spent
two years pretending

00:00:17.246 --> 00:00:18.800 line:82% align:center
that had been the plan.
